Z||000003||tgowens||11-21-2000||10:05 PM||||Bill, the "goldish" color is actually called Roman Bronze and it is the trim color for the tan interior (except for the '88 "Beechwood" interior because, as you know, the '88 used the microdot trim bezels.......hope this helps........<P>------------------<BR>                  <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/tgowens_sig.gif">                              <P><A HREF="http://www.cfog.org" TARGET=_blank>www.cfog.org</A> - Classic Fiero Owners Group<BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.net/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroshop.net/</A> - Fiero Shop - Richmond, CA - 1-510-23-FIERO||||reg||1
